## 15. Git Workflow

### 15.1 Branch Naming

- `main` - Production-ready code
- `develop` - Development branch
- `feature/{module}-{description}` - Feature branches
- `fix/{module}-{description}` - Bug fix branches
- `test/{module}-{description}` - Test-related branches

### 15.2 Commit Messages

- Use **conventional commits** format
- Format: `{type}({scope}): {description}`
- Types: `feat`, `fix`, `test`, `refactor`, `docs`, `chore`

Example:
```
feat(user): add user creation service
test(user): add unit tests for create user handler
fix(kyc): handle KYC provider timeout errors
```

