### 18.8 Settings Module Error Codes

| Code | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `VALIDATION_ERROR` | Request validation failed |
| `UNAUTHORIZED` | User is not authenticated or lacks permission |
| `NOT_FOUND` | Resource not found |
| `INVALID_PASSWORD` | Current password is incorrect |
| `PASSWORD_MISMATCH` | New password and confirm password do not match |
| `EMAIL_ALREADY_EXISTS` | Email is already registered |
| `SESSION_NOT_FOUND` | Session ID not found |
| `MEMBER_NOT_FOUND` | Team member not found |
| `CANNOT_REMOVE_SELF` | Cannot remove yourself from team |
| `SYSTEM_ROLE_IMMUTABLE` | System role cannot be modified or deleted |
| `ROLE_IN_USE` | Role is assigned to users and cannot be deleted |

